## Open Threads

- Exact founding date (month/day) in 2021 — only year confirmed from Forbes profile and team page
- Precise funding round dates, amounts, and valuations for each investor — Messari report references but single aggregated source
- Whether Moksha testnet state was migrated to mainnet or reset — not explicitly documented in blog posts or docs
- Complete TGE unlock schedule (vesting cliffs, team/investor allocations) — whitepaper mentions but full schedule not published in single verifiable source
- Exact mainnet genesis block timestamp and initial validator set — explorer shows but not aggregated in one source
- VANA token fee switch / revenue share mechanism activation status — whitepaper mentions but governance status unclear
- Total treasury size and composition (stable vs VANA) — not disclosed publicly
- Auditor firms for Vana smart contracts — not publicly announced
- Market maker / liquidity provider arrangements for VANA token — not disclosed
- Enterprise partnerships beyond Data DAOs — not publicly documented
- Grant program recipients and amounts — not aggregated in single source
- Regulatory status of Data DAOs in various jurisdictions — whitepaper acknowledges uncertainty
- Complete core team headcount and org chart — only partial public disclosure
- Exact legal name and registration number of Vana Foundation in Cayman Islands registry — not fully public